{"asset_key":"ep6/herohub_story_16411200","episode":"ep6","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"16411200","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1641120001:1":{"text":"공주님, 조심하십시오. 출처가 불분명한 음식들이라 문제라도 생긴다면...","source_cn":"殿下，请小心，这些食物来源不明，万一有问题……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD32BC9F867D9956","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1641120002:1":{"text":"아이참, 다들 걱정이 지나치군요.","source_cn":"唉呀，你们未免太紧张啦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84FA51A1784B2A35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1641120003:1":{"text":"이건 “무지개 전병”이란 건데 베어 물면 안에서 무지갯빛 연기가 피어올라요. 정말 재밌지 않나요?","source_cn":"这叫“幻彩纸饼”，咬开之后里面会冒出彩色烟雾，是不是很有趣？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x297714F588E1CCFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1641120004:1":{"text":"그리고 이 “달빛 완자”는 온도에 따라 색이 변해요. 뜨거울 땐 금빛이, 식으면 은빛이 나죠.","source_cn":"还有这串“月亮丸子”，会随着温度变色，热的时候是金色，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D11ECC2B27461A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1641120005:1":{"text":"전부 마법 간식일 뿐이에요. 이상한 물건이 아니라고요.","source_cn":"都是一些魔法小吃而已，不是什么奇怪的东西。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8124F14CD12F7B39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1641120006:1":{"text":"하지만, 공주님...","source_cn":"可是，殿下……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64E2E6C04178BE6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1641120007:1":{"text":"“하지만”은 무슨! 로완이 이 음식들 먹는 걸 자주 봤는데 아무 일도 없었어요.","source_cn":"没什么可是的！我可没少见罗万吃这些东西，他也没出什么事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DCF9405A5C8A07E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1641120008:1":{"text":"그리고 정말 무슨 일이 생긴다고 하더라도 여러분이 있잖아요?","source_cn":"再说啦，就算真的有问题，不是还有你们吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x454503E00BDEFFB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1641120009:1":{"text":"아니면 우리 같이 먹죠! 내가 살 게요!","source_cn":"要不这样，你们跟我一起吃好了！全部由本公主请客！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6703C9D7EA0D325E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1641120010:1":{"text":"그, 그게... 공주님...","source_cn":"这、这……殿下……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21C975101765EAB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1641120011:1":{"text":"하하, 벌 주는 것도 아닌데 뭘 그렇게들 놀라요.","source_cn":"哈哈，看把你们吓得，又不是惩罚你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72667B3AC53C8EA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1641120012:1":{"text":"다들 나랑 같이 먹어요! 정말 맛있다니까요!","source_cn":"所有人都跟我一起吃！很好吃的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50FF24E58F320346","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:帝国士兵":{"text":"제국 병사","source":"帝国士兵","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:佩吉":{"text":"페기","source":"佩吉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":2}}